# Files in this repository are stored via Git LFS, so the repository stays small
# and clones are fast.
#
# IMPORTANT for anyone reading the wallpapers.json files:
# the image URLs point at media.githubusercontent.com, not raw.githubusercontent.com.
# That is deliberate. Once a file is tracked by LFS, the raw endpoint returns the
# LFS *pointer* (about 130 bytes of text) rather than the image, so the apps would
# receive nothing usable. The media endpoint serves the actual content.
# The manifests themselves stay on the raw endpoint, which serves ordinary files
# correctly, and every installed app already has that URL baked in.
*.webp filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.png filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.jpg filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.jpeg filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
